>
<p class=3D"xxmsolistparagraph" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:0cm;margin-righ=
t:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:36.0pt">
<span style=3D"font-size:11.0pt">The variable votemargin divided by the num=
ber of eligible voters is the assignment variable for the RD implementation=
. The issue is that the data does not include the number of eligible voters=
. Could you try to find them?<o:p></o:p></span></p>
